binary outcome data these can give false-positive rates that are higher than the nominal level in some situations (large
treatment effects, or few events per trial, or all trials of similar sizes). We develop a modified linear regression 
test for funnel plot asymmetry based on the efficient score and its variance, Fisher\'s information. The performance of 
